# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Docs split
#
# TRACKED (cloned to every machine): living specs, remaining task boards,
# and runbooks that another agent needs to keep working. See AGENTS.md.
#   readmes/SPECs/*          TECH_SPEC, DESIGN_SPEC, BLOG_VISUALS
#   readmes/SEOPLAN.md       remaining owner SEO/analytics tasks
#   readmes/DEPLOY_VOICE_AGENT.md
#   readmes/WORKING_ON.md, readmes/optimizations.md
#   docs/SEO_SETUP.md
#   README.md, agent/RUN.md, AGENTS.md
#
# LOCAL ONLY (this machine; copy by hand if you still want them elsewhere):
#   the rest of readmes/, docs/voice-feature/, left.md, prompt dumps,
#   machine-local agent config, secrets.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
readmes/*
!readmes/SPECs/
!readmes/SPECs/**
!readmes/SEOPLAN.md
!readmes/DEPLOY_VOICE_AGENT.md
!readmes/WORKING_ON.md
!readmes/optimizations.md
docs/voice-feature/
left.md
promptlatest.md
status.md

# Machine-local assistant config (Windows paths, permission allowlists).
# CLAUDE.md is tracked: it holds the owner's working rules for every session.
.claude/
GEMINI.md

# Scratch LiveKit scaffold kept for local experiments only
tests/voicetest*
